---
args: { input: CaseInput, goal: GoalContract, policy: PolicySelection, evidencePlan: EvidencePlan, previous: ReuseInvestigation[] }
returns: PreparedEvidence
---
Prepare a bounded, source-versioned evidence slice for compareFeasibility. Compare concepts using exact supplied estimates, known constraints, functional benefits, and unresolved conditions. Present phased or contingent options and clear next decisions, separating creative promise from verified technical or regulatory feasibility. Include direct observations, current authority, contrary evidence, a plausible rival interpretation, and missing decisive fields. Carry forward the actual prior-stage records when provided.
